    <rdfs:label>InsideTheKitchenTheWoodOvenNamedDante</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Inside the kitchen, the wood oven named Dante burns oak logs and holds a temperature near 430 degrees Celsius.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
