  <owl:Class rdf:about="https://orion.local/resource/luca">
    <rdfs:label>Luca</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Luca grates aged parmesan over the edge, while Sofia places basil leaves in a triangle so guests can see the recipe pattern clearly.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Luca turns the pizza twice and records the bake time as ninety seconds in the service notebook.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="https://orion.local/resource/luigi">
    <rdfs:label>Luigi</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label>Luigi roles subject object</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Luigi confirms the order with Nina by phone, writes the destination as Central Cafe on Pine Street, and attaches the ticket to a red thermal bag.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Luigi scans the label, places the box beside the salad, and leaves Mario&#x27;s Pizzeria on a blue bicycle.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>He rides from Harbor Market to Pine Street, passes the public library, and reaches Central Cafe at 12:18 p.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Nina tells Luigi that the basil aroma matches the request, and Luigi records the delivery as completed.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="https://orion.local/resource/luigibianchi">
    <rdfs:label>LuigiBianchi</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label>LuigiBianchi roles subject object</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Luigi Bianchi manages delivery orders for Mario&#x27;s Pizzeria.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>At noon he receives an order from Central Cafe for one Vesuvio pie, one Marinara pizza, and a small arugula salad.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="https://orion.local/resource/luigirecordthedeliveryascompleted">
    <rdfs:label>LuigiRecordTheDeliveryAsCompleted</rdfs:label>
