  <owl:Class rdf:about="https://orion.local/resource/sofia">
    <rdfs:label>Sofia</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Sofia stretches dough made from Caputo flour, warm water, sea salt, and a slow sourdough starter.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Sofia crushes the tomatoes with basil, olive oil, and a pinch of oregano.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Sofia slides the Vesuvio pie onto the oven floor with a long metal peel.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>After lunch, Sofia reviews the notebook.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Sofia stores the proofing box, cleans the metal peel, and updates the recipe card for the next Saturday service.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:Class>
